  "instructions": [
    "grill pork shoulder at 400°F for 15 minutes, then let rest for 5 minutes before slicing.",
    "in a separate pan, combine rice flour, cinnamon, and ground ginger. Cook over low heat for 5 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "gradually add coconut milk, stirring frequently. Bring to a simmer and let cook for 5 minutes.",
    "stir in dulce de leche, dashi sodium extract, salt, and black pepper. Bring to a simmer and let cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "serve over the grilled pork shoulder"
